From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 16:46:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] droidvdec: do not take the stream lock again in drain()

GstVideoDecoder calls drain() with the stream lock held
(gst_video_decoder_drain_out(): "This function has to be called with the
stream lock taken"). gst_droidvdec_drain() took it a second time, and
_finish () only lets go of it once while it waits for the codec's EOS. The
lock stayed held through that wait, so the codec's callbacks, which need
it (_size_changed (), _frame_available ()), blocked, EOS never came, and
the pipeline hung on its first drain. playbin3/decodebin3 drain the decoder
right after it starts, so with droidvdec's hardware-buffer output every
video stopped there: on the HP TouchPad, Qt Multimedia's player stayed at
"Loading" with the decoder thread in _finish () and the codec callback
thread in _size_changed () waiting on the stream lock.

Rely on the base class's hold of the lock instead.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 gst/droidcodec/gstdroidvdec.c | 10 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gst/droidcodec/gstdroidvdec.c b/gst/droidcodec/gstdroidvdec.c
index 01376ca..5644b8d 100644
--- a/gst/droidcodec/gstdroidvdec.c
+++ b/gst/droidcodec/gstdroidvdec.c
@@ -1303,21 +1303,23 @@ gst_droidvdec_drain (GstVideoDecoder * decoder)
 
   GST_DEBUG_OBJECT (dec, "drain");
 
-  GST_VIDEO_DECODER_STREAM_LOCK (decoder);
+  /* GstVideoDecoder calls drain() with the stream lock already held, and
+   * _finish () lets go of it once while it waits for the codec's EOS, so the
+   * codec's callbacks (_size_changed (), _frame_available ()) can take it.
+   * Taking it again here would leave it held through that wait: the callbacks
+   * block, EOS never comes, and the pipeline hangs on its first drain. */
 
   GST_DROIDVDEC_STATE_LOCK (dec);
 
   if (G_UNLIKELY (!dec->running)) {
     GST_DEBUG_OBJECT (dec, "codec is not running");
     GST_DROIDVDEC_STATE_UNLOCK (dec);
-    GST_VIDEO_DECODER_STREAM_UNLOCK (decoder);
     return GST_FLOW_FLUSHING;
   }
 
   if (dec->state == GST_DROID_VDEC_STATE_WAITING_FOR_EOS) {
     GST_DEBUG_OBJECT (dec, "already draining");
     GST_DROIDVDEC_STATE_UNLOCK (dec);
-    GST_VIDEO_DECODER_STREAM_UNLOCK (decoder);
     return GST_FLOW_EOS;
   }
 
@@ -1325,8 +1327,6 @@ gst_droidvdec_drain (GstVideoDecoder * decoder)
 
   ret = gst_droidvdec_finish (decoder);
 
-  GST_VIDEO_DECODER_STREAM_UNLOCK (decoder);
-
   return ret;
 }
 
